controls.description:
Mechanisms exist to allow secure baseline configurations to be specialized or customized by applying a defined set of tailoring actions that are specific to:
(1) Mission / business functions;
(2) Operational environment;
(3) Specific threats or vulnerabilities; or
(4) Other conditions or situations that could affect mission / business success.

